# What `make qemu-test` types into QEMU (NoWayOS's tools/qemu-test), a step
# at a time, waiting for the application to say where it is: Tab to the name,
# a name, Tab to Continue, Enter; then Tab to Start again, Enter. The name is
# a marker starter.expect forbids in the log: nothing typed is ever printed.

wait STARTER: ui: showing welcome
key tab
key z q v j
key tab
key ret
wait STARTER: ui: showing hello
key tab
key ret
wait STARTER: ui: showing welcome
